        "{\"a2uiMeta\":{\"note\":\"It's a mild, dry evening in Sorrento, about 21°C with no rain, so it's a good night to be outside.\\n\\nHere are a few options:\\n\\n- **Harbor cruise at 17:00:** If you still want it, it's the best way to see the coast at sunset. Ask the front desk whether seats remain.\\n- **Dinner at Vela:** Our fine-dining restaurant, a good choice for a special evening. I can help you reserve a table.\\n- **Quay Bar:** A more relaxed option for drinks or a casual bite.\\n- **Spa:** Open until 20:00. A massage or facial would be a good way to unwind, but treatments need to be booked at least a day ahead in season, so tonight may be tight.\\n- **Pool:** Open until 22:00 if you'd like a late swim.\\n\\nWould you like me to book a table at Vela or the Quay Bar, or look into a spa slot?\",\"trace\":{\"turnIndex\":4,\"query\":{\"intent\":\"Read my mind: what should I do this evening?\",\"k\":3},\"exemplarIds\":[\"domain-concierge-booking-request\",\"frontier-service-gateway\",\"frontier-greet-card\"],\"rounds\":1,\"healed\":0,\"failureCodes\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"prompt\":{\"limit\":142000,\"total\":55692,\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"grammar\",\"chars\":25605},{\"id\":\"components\",\"chars\":20315},{\"id\":\"functions\",\"chars\":145},{\"id\":\"few-shot\",\"chars\":3844},{\"id\":\"mini-skills\",\"chars\":804},{\"id\":\"persona\",\"chars\":4979}],\"over\":false},\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":8524,\"outputTokens\":754,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":35518,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0},\"miniSkillIds\":[\"greeting-card\"],\"cacheBoundary\":46065}}}"
