          "text": "It's a mild, dry evening in Sorrento, about 21°C with no rain, so it's a good night to be outside.\n\nHere are a few options:\n\n- **Harbor cruise at 17:00:** If you still want it, it's the best way to see the coast at sunset. Ask the front desk whether seats remain.\n- **Dinner at Vela:** Our fine-dining restaurant, a good choice for a special evening. I can help you reserve a table.\n- **Quay Bar:** A more relaxed option for drinks or a casual bite.\n- **Spa:** Open until 20:00. A massage or facial would be a good way to unwind, but treatments need to be booked at least a day ahead in season, so tonight may be tight.\n- **Pool:** Open until 22:00 if you'd like a late swim.\n\nWould you like me to book a table at Vela or the Quay Bar, or look into a spa slot?",
